-- A price range the addon builds itself ("2g 50s to 3g") reads with a dash.
-- Only a number, its money units and "to" between them are touched.
function language.TransformVisible(s)
  return (s:gsub("(%d[%w%s]-%s)to(%s%d)", "%1—%2"))
end

